<title>JAPAN: Kubota shares gain ground.</title>
<headline>Kubota shares gain ground.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kubota Corp, a leading maker of farm equipment and iron pipes, rose on Monday morning, attracting investors as a laggard among shares of companies which manufacture environment-friendly incinerators, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0121 GMT, Kubota shares were up eight yen at 570. Trading volume was 309,000 shares.</p>
